WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.879
Finally, there might be things about Mike that make Mr. Ramos' words hurt more.

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:07.679
Some people feel things more strongly.

00:00:07.679 --> 00:00:10.480
If they get a nice compliment, they feel really happy.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.679
But if someone yells at them, they might get very angry.

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:17.839
We call these people sponges because they soak up everything around them.

00:00:17.839 --> 00:00:23.120
Other people aren't changed or impacted as easily by things and people around them.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.160
We call these people iron because they are hard to change.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.280
Whether we are a sponge or iron has to do with our genes, how our bodies handle stress,

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.600
and how our brain works, things that start even before we are born.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.759
But what's cool is that we can still change as we grow up.

00:00:41.759 --> 00:00:47.600
So some people can start more like a sponge and move towards being iron or vice versa.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:51.840
And all people are a sponge for some things and iron for other things.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.359
That is, everyone has things that might bother them more than most,

00:00:55.359 --> 00:00:59.039
as well as things that might bother them less than most.

